ial production deployment of Google Flights app\n- Flight search with origin/destination airports, date pickers, passenger/cabin selectors\n- Search results with filtering (stops, airlines, price, duration) and pagination\n- Flight booking flow with passenger forms, price breakdown, and confirmation\n- My Trips page with upcoming/past/cancelled tabs and booking management\n- Explore page with destination map, flexible dates grid, and deals section\n- Popular destinations and recent searches on home page\n- Tracked price routes functionality\n- Full backend with Netlify Functions and Neon Postgres database\n\n--- Deployment 2026-03-15 ---\nChanges:\n- Fixed test suites across all components (filter sidebar, flight cards, pagination, passenger forms, etc.)\n- Schema sync and redeployment to production\n","numLines":22,"startLine":1,"totalLines":22}}}
